    "details": "<p><strong>Note: \"The registration will be confirmed via a confirmation email\"<br /><br />Overview:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Experience hackathon culture in a completely new and engaging way!</li>\n<li class=\"isSelectedEnd\">This event introduces students to the world of hackathons through a fun, interactive, and challenge-driven experience rather than the conventional high-pressure format.</li>\n<li class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Participants will take on a series of exciting tasks designed to develop essential skills such as time management, pressure management, prioritisation, problem-solving, and quick decision-making.</li>\n<li class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A key focus of the event is Vibe Coding and the effective use of AI tools for project development. Participants will learn how to leverage modern AI-powered tools to ideate, build, and improve projects efficiently, making technology and innovation more accessible and enjoyable.</li>\n<li>Through a combination of challenges, teamwork, creativity, and hands-on activities, the event aims to encourage active participation, practical learning, and meaningful skill development&mdash;giving students a taste of the hackathon experience while keeping it energetic, approachable, and fun.<br /><br />Registration Fee: 500<br /><br />Once your registration is successfully finalized, you will receive an official confirmation email. This email will serve as proof of completion and will also include details of the payment to be done.&nbsp;<br /><br /><br /></li>\n</ul>",
